        "id": "LeeSinWOne",
        "name": "Safeguard / Iron Will",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Safeguard: Lee Sin rushes to target ally, shielding himself from damage. If the ally is a champion, they are also shielded. After using Safeguard, Lee Sin can cast Iron Will.<br>Iron Will: Lee Sin's intense training allows him to thrive in battle. Lee Sin gains Omnivamp.",
        "bodyHtml": "Lee Sin dashes to an ally or ward. If the target is a champion, Lee Sin grants them and himself <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-300\">(60/105/150/195/240 + (80% Ability Power)) Shield</span> for 2 seconds. Lee Sin may <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-300\">Recast</span> for the next 3 seconds.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-300\">Recast:</span> Lee Sin gains 10/14/18/22/26% Omnivamp for 4 seconds.",
