        "name": "Tempest / Cripple",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Tempest: Lee Sin smashes the ground, sending out a shockwave that deals magic damage and reveals enemy units hit. If Tempest hits an enemy, Lee Sin can cast cripple.<br>Cripple: Lee Sin cripples nearby enemies damaged by Tempest, reducing their Move Speed. Move Speed recovers gradually over the duration.",
        "bodyHtml": "Lee Sin smashes the ground, sending out a shockwave that deals <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(35/60/85/110/135 + (90% Attack Damage)) magic damage</span> and reveals them for 4 seconds. If this hits an enemy, Lee Sin can <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-300\">Recast</span> for the next 3 seconds.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-300\">Recast:</span> Lee Sin <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slows</span> nearby enemies struck by the shockwave by 35/45/55/65/75% decaying over 4 seconds.",
